<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53149" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾰπετώλιον</span></b> , τό,
			= Lat. <u>Capitolium</u>, <i><span class="en">
			D.H.
			1.34
		</span></i> (v.l.), etc.:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾰπετώλιος</span></b> , ὁ, =
		<u>Capitolinus</u>, epith. of Zeus = Jupiter, <i><span class="en">
			Paus.
			2.4.5
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			694.24
		</span></i> (Elaea, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), etc.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾰπετωλιονίκης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[νῑ]</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>victor in the Ludi
				Capitolini,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sammelb.
				5725
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾰπετώλιος</span></b> , ὁ (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), name of month of <i>December,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				2.140
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾰπετώλια</span></b> , τά, =
			<i>Ludi Capitolini,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				3.129
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
